WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Read the commission context
Match each commission to its order, rate, currency and status. A
captured or settled commission is separate from the vendor receiving a
payout.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Check the period statement
Check statement period, currency, net amount and status. Gross sales,
commission deductions and paid net are not interchangeable figures.

3
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Read available and held credit
Read available credit and its ledger, not just the total. Holds reserve
value; gift-card claims and refunds require their own recorded
transactions.

4
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Check configuration boundaries
Read editable fields and platform-controlled values separately. A
displayed setting does not by itself prove a related workflow is
enabled.

